### 1. 영화 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/movies
Accept: application/json

### 2. 영화 예매 생성 (어벤져스 E1, E2)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reservations": [
    {
      "screeningId": 101,
      "seats": ["E1", "E2"]
    }
  ],
  "usedPoints": 1000,
  "paymentMethod": "CREDIT_CARD"
}

### 3. 잘못된 좌석 예매 시도 (400 Bad Request 확인)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reservations": [
    {
      "screeningId": 101,
      "seats": ["E1"]
    }
  ],
  "usedPoints": 0,
  "paymentMethod": "CASH"
}
